                                                "text": "I am free of all prejudices. I hate everyone equally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68b0c0bb-828f-4f31-9e3e-9d1e55eb613b",
                                                "sense_id": "43c66e98-e934-3e78-93a8-678a8eabf76e",
                                                "text": "\"I did not thoroughly understand what you were telling your brother,\" cried Emma, \"about your friend Mr. Graham's intending to have a bailiff from Scotland, to look after his new estate. But will it answer? Will not the old prejudice be too strong?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
